 ],
 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "them",
   "start": 2.0,
   "end": 10.01,
   "text": "好，人都到齐了，我们开始吧。今天主要对一下 0.22 版的发布计划。",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "them",
   "start": 10.49,
   "end": 17.28,
   "text": "先说时间，原定下周三发，现在桌面端还有两个问题没收尾。",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "me",
   "start": 18.8,
   "end": 28.07,
   "text": "录音和转写这边已经在 Mac 上跑通了，Windows 的系统声音还没接上。",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s4",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "me",
   "start": 28.98,
   "end": 36.86,
   "text": "我建议先发 Mac 和 Linux，Windows 放到下一个小版本。",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s5",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "them",
   "start": 38.49,
   "end": 40.89,
   "text": "可以，这样不卡整体进度。",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s6",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "them",
   "start": 41.39,
   "end": 44.48,
   "text": "那安装包里要不要带上转写模型？",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s7",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "me",
   "start": 46.79,
   "end": 54.94,
   "text": "不带。模型一百六十兆，第一次用的时候再下载，走系统代理，国内也能下。",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s8",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "them",
   "start": 56.22,
   "end": 59.64,
   "text": "下载失败的时候用户看得到原因吗？",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s9",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "me",
   "start": 62.15,
   "end": 68.43,
   "text": "看得到，会直接写出是哪一步没下成，还能点再试一次。",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s10",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "them",
   "start": 70.0,
   "end": 76.93,
   "text": "好。第二个问题是权限，第一次录电脑声音会弹系统的授权框。",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s11",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "me",
   "start": 77.91,
   "end": 87.79,
   "text": "对，macOS 叫「系统录音」，没给的话那条波形会一直是平的，页面上会提醒。",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s12",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "them",
   "start": 89.19,
   "end": 94.83,
   "text": "这个提示要写清楚去哪里打开，别让人自己找。",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s13",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "me",
   "start": 95.93,
   "end": 103.21,
   "text": "嗯，我把路径写进提示里：系统设置、隐私与安全性、屏幕与系统录音。",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s14",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "them",
   "start": 105.5,
   "end": 108.45,
   "text": "说到体验，转写大概要多久？",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s15",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "me",
   "start": 110.34,
   "end": 115.99,
   "text": "本机转，一小时的会两三分钟，边转边出字，不用干等。",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s16",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "them",
   "start": 117.52,
   "end": 120.7,
   "text": "那挺快的。区分说话人呢？",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s17",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "me",
   "start": 121.71,
   "end": 129.07,
   "text": "现在先按两条音轨分：我自己是麦克风，别人是电脑放出来的声音。",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s18",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "me",
   "start": 129.68,
   "end": 137.8,
   "text": "对方有好几个人的话，下一步用声纹再分开，改过一次名字以后就能自动认出来。",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s19",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "them",
   "start": 139.43,
   "end": 145.78,
   "text": "这个很关键，开周会的时候五六个人，分不开就没法看。",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s20",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "them",
   "start": 146.77,
   "end": 152.85,
   "text": "另外纪要那块，我们是不是可以直接让 agent 写？",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s21",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "me",
   "start": 154.26,
   "end": 162.69,
   "text": "可以，文字稿就在网页的数据里，agent 读了就能写总结、决定和待办。",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s22",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "me",
   "start": 163.79,
   "end": 169.1,
   "text": "还能顺手画一张白板，把讨论的方案画出来。",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s23",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "them",
   "start": 170.98,
   "end": 173.38,
   "text": "好，这个放到第三步。",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s24",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "them",
   "start": 174.65,
   "end": 177.67,
   "text": "那文档和更新说明谁来写？",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s25",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "me",
   "start": 179.06,
   "end": 182.6,
   "text": "我来写，周二之前给大家看。",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s26",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "them",
   "start": 183.7,
   "end": 187.35,
   "text": "测试这边呢，谁来过一遍？",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s27",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "me",
   "start": 189.54,
   "end": 197.69,
   "text": "我在自己的 Mac 上录几场真实的会，腾讯会议和 Zoom 各一场。",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s28",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "them",
   "start": 199.42,
   "end": 203.35,
   "text": "飞书会议也录一场吧，我们自己天天用。",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s29",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "me",
   "start": 205.39,
   "end": 209.16,
   "text": "好的，三场都录，问题记在任务追踪里。",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s30",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "them",
   "start": 211.03,
   "end": 213.43,
   "text": "发版那天谁值班？",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s31",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "me",
   "start": 214.87,
   "end": 218.37,
   "text": "我值上午，下午交给小李。",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s32",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "them",
   "start": 220.28,
   "end": 229.78,
   "text": "行，那就这么定：下周三发 Mac 和 Linux，Windows 下周再说。",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s33",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "them",
   "start": 230.63,
   "end": 234.92,
   "text": "还有别的吗？没有的话今天就到这里。",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s34",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "me",
   "start": 237.43,
   "end": 240.17,
   "text": "没有了，谢谢大家。",
   "edited": false
  }
 ]
}